# {{appNameBase}} SDK - AI Agent Reference

## Installation

Add the SDK to your project via Composer:

```bash
composer require {{#packageName}}{{packageName}}{{/packageName}}{{^packageName}}openapi/{{#lambda.lowercase}}{{invokerPackage}}{{/lambda.lowercase}}{{/packageName}}
```

## Quick Start

```php
use {{invokerPackage}}\{{clientClassName}};

$client = {{clientClassName}}::withToken('https://api.example.com', 'your-token');
```

## Authentication

All authentication is handled via `Authenticator` implementations passed to the client constructor.

### Bearer Token

```php
use {{invokerPackage}}\Auth\BearerAuthenticator;

$authenticator = new BearerAuthenticator('https://api.example.com', 'your-token');
$client = new {{clientClassName}}($authenticator);
```

{{#hasBasicAuth}}
### Basic Auth

```php
use {{invokerPackage}}\Auth\BasicAuthenticator;

$authenticator = new BasicAuthenticator('https://api.example.com', 'username', 'password');
$client = new {{clientClassName}}($authenticator);
```

{{/hasBasicAuth}}
